   "body_html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>Slice the chicken.</li><li>Chop the garlic; slice the spring onion whites and cut the greens into short lengths.</li><li>Crush the peanuts, cut the lime into wedges.</li><li>Stir the sauce until the sugar dissolves:<ul class=\"ing\"><li>tamarind purée <span class=\"amt\">1½ tbsp</span></li><li>fish sauce <span class=\"amt\">1 tbsp</span></li><li>brown or palm sugar <span class=\"amt\">1 tbsp</span></li><li>warm water <span class=\"amt\">2 tbsp</span></li></ul></li></ul>",
   "heat": null,
