  {
   "body_html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>Heat <b>half the oil</b> over medium-high heat.</li><li>Fry the chicken until cooked through.</li><li>Add garlic and spring onion whites for the final 30 seconds, then transfer to a clean plate.</li></ul>",
